     "content": {
      "size": -1,
      "mimeType": "application/json",
      "text": "{\"project_id\":\"project-1d39fa642bb64f3babc89de38cc621a2\",\"shot_id\":\"shot-938a545b754e400681a1bd5dac8a6cb0\",\"project_version\":9,\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"3ee134ae-a0cd-4013-b2f0-15a8d22fa97a\",\"entity_id\":\"result-3ee134ae-a0cd-4013-b2f0-15a8d22fa97a\",\"job_id\":\"fe8999d4-defc-4278-90c4-bbf5f4503999\",\"source_shot_id\":\"shot-938a545b754e400681a1bd5dac8a6cb0\",\"aliased\":false,\"trash_state\":\"active\",\"trash_version\":9,\"recipe_status\":\"known\",\"recipe\":{\"controls\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"duration\":5,\"generate_audio\":true,\"resolution\":\"480P\",\"seed\":\"3529117410\"},\"inputs\":{\"audios\":[],\"first_frame\":null,\"guides\":[],\"images\":[{\"asset_id\":\"bdd681dff19c4fb5974fdd6577f2b06c\"}],\"last_frame\":null,\"videos\":[]},\"prompt\":\"老火车站月台：雨夜中空旷的老式火车站月台，有复古木质长椅与散发暖黄色光晕的旧路灯，湿漉漉的地面倒映着灯光，铁轨延伸向迷蒙雨雾中。；默认：\\n小男孩：约7岁的小男孩，身穿亮黄色连帽雨衣和雨靴，兜帽下露出细碎黑发，眼神纯真而安静。；默认造型：\\n橘猫：毛茸茸的胖橘猫，毛发微湿，性格温顺黏人，蜷缩在男孩怀里。\\n大雨冲刷着夜色中的老火车站月台，暖黄色的路灯在湿漉地面晕开倒影。穿亮黄雨衣的小男孩独自坐在长椅上，双手紧抱着怀里的橘猫。（听见淅淅沥沥的雨声和远处闷雷声。）\",\"recipe_id\":\"video-ref-v1\",\"tier\":null,\"mode\":\"ref\"},\"authoring_context\":{\"global_defaults\":{},\"links\":[],\"profiles\":[{\"data\":{\"defaultLookId\":\"main\",\"looks\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"gallery\":{},\"id\":\"main\",\"imageIds\":[\"image-pic-d306d73baedf-a-24eef242b6e45f\"],\"name\":\"默认造型\",\"version\":2}],\"mainVoiceId\":\"\",\"voices\":[]},\"description\":\"约7岁的小男孩，身穿亮黄色连帽雨衣和雨靴，兜帽下露出细碎黑发，眼神纯真而安静。\",\"id\":\"character-420149b4acb8459ba624eef242b6e45f\",\"order\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"小男孩\",\"type\":\"character\",\"version\":2},{\"data\":{\"ambient\":null,\"defaultVersionId\":\"main\",\"versions\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"main\",\"imageIds\":[],\"name\":\"默认\",\"version\":1}]},\"description\":\"雨夜中空旷的老式火车站月台，有复古木质长椅与散发暖黄色光晕的旧路灯，湿漉漉的地面倒映着灯光，铁轨延伸向迷蒙雨雾中。\",\"id\":\"location-9d851b097e9f49a68ea7678f58a31fac\",\"order\":3,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"老火车站月台\",\"type\":\"location\",\"version\":1},{\"data\":{\"imageIds\":[]},\"description\":\"毛茸茸的胖橘猫，毛发微湿，性格温顺黏人，蜷缩在男孩怀里。\",\"id\":\"prop-a14631c7e21241d4aabc9b5e82f7322d\",\"order\":4,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"橘猫\",\"type\":\"prop\",\"version\":1}],\"scene\":{\"data\":{\"script\":\"\"},\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"scene-263a1532bd1d5dfbbfb16f9ca00d4ed3\",\"order\":0,\"parentId\":\"chapter-ebbac113d8d3590092dddc4133fc8c6d\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"Scene 1\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"version\":1},\"shot\":{\"data\":{\"cast\":[{\"characterId\":\"character-420149b4acb8459ba624eef242b6e45f\",\"lookId\":\"\"}],\"prompt\":\"大雨冲刷着夜色中的老火车站月台，暖黄色的路灯在湿漉地面晕开倒影。穿亮黄雨衣的小男孩独自坐在长椅上，双手紧抱着怀里的橘猫。（听见淅淅沥沥的雨声和远处闷雷声。）\",\"seconds\":5,\"storyboard\":{\"mode\":\"ref\",\"place\":{\"locationId\":\"location-9d851b097e9f49a68ea7678f58a31fac\"},\"propIds\":[\"prop-a14631c7e21241d4aabc9b5e82f7322d\"],\"quality\":\"draft\",\"version\":1}},\"description\":\"大雨冲刷着夜色中的老火车站月台，暖黄色的路灯在湿漉地面晕开倒影。穿亮黄雨衣的小男孩独自坐在长椅上，双手紧抱着怀里的橘猫。（听见淅淅沥沥的雨声和远处闷雷声。）\",\"id\":\"shot-938a545b754e400681a1bd5dac8a6cb0\",\"order\":0,\"parentId\":\"scene-263a1532bd1d5dfbbfb16f9ca00d4ed3\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"shot\",\"version\":1},\"storyboard\":{}},\"starred\":false,\"title\":\"Generated result\",\"annotation_version\":9,\"selected\":true,\"created_at\":1793105591.7611911,\"kind\":\"video\",\"enhanced_to\":null,\"quality_flags\":[],\"quality_checks\":{\"burned_subtitles\":{\"detector\":\"dialogue-ocr-v1\",\"status\":\"no_dialogue\"}},\"content_url\":\"/v1/artifacts/3ee134ae-a0cd-4013-b2f0-15a8d22fa97a/content\",\"renditions\":{\"thumb\":{\"content_url\":\"/v1/artifacts/3ee134ae-a0cd-4013-b2f0-15a8d22fa97a/content?rendition=thumb\",\"width\":320,\"height\":185,\"size_bytes\":11122,\"sha256\":\"8e79b0740427c98fffe9f6b99c7ba9374b0c1092a6099a92e04de14e42dad64b\",\"content_type\":\"image/webp\",\"immutable\":true},\"preview\":{\"content_url\":\"/v1/artifacts/3ee134ae-a0cd-4013-b2f0-15a8d22fa97a/content?rendit